  "statuteText": "383-A:5-503 Notice of Election. –\n\nWithin 30 days after the acceptance by a director of a state bank or credit union of his or her election or appointment, the state bank or credit union shall notify the commissioner of the name and residence address of the director who was elected or appointed."
